  "text": "Kalphite King — Solo Ranged\n\n​\nIntroduction\nThis guide assumes you are already familiar with the basic mechanics of Kalphite King, which can be found in #unknown-channel\n​\nBeing on a Kalphite Slayer task  for slayer helm  and Genocidal  is completely optional, but will result in slightly faster kills.\n​\nThis guide assumes no green shields happen, but they are very rare and generally won't ruin kills.\n​\nPreset and Relics\n⬥ Ranged \n​\n\nNotes\n⬥  set the autofire rate to 1.\n⬥  switch has  to prevent stuns for almost the entire kill.\n⬥  and  increase damage to help ensure the rotation ends consistently at 13.2-14.4 seconds.\n⬥ Toss the  1-2 ticks before clicking on Kalphite King, otherwise Melee phase might null your click.\n​\nRotation\nPre-build:\n  → Enter portal\nEasier  build: Enter instance + drop  →  →    →  →  →  →  →   → s (at 2  stacks)\n​\nHarder  build (more consistent):  → Enter instance + drop  →    →  →  →  →  → s → r +   → s (at 2  stacks)\nIn the fight:\nr +   → ‎ ‎ →   →   ( 2t later) →  → \n​\nIf you don't kill after the last , finish with   and improvise.\n​\nIf you get Melee phase spawn,  after   and using   over the first  is an option to help ensure a 13.2 second kill, but not necessary.\n​\nPost-fight building:\nTarget kalphite marauder +   →   →  \n​\nThese  ensure you can both skip gaining adrenaline at crystal for  and avoid the  during the pre-build, saving both banking time and supplies. The harder  build also makes it harder to gain adrenaline from  if you get a slower kill if you time  wrong.\n​\nExample Kills\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nExample Kills\n⬥ 90 kph\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n      \n    ",
  "normalizedText": "Kalphite King — Solo Ranged ​ Introduction This guide assumes you are already familiar with the basic mechanics of Kalphite King, which can be found in #unknown-channel ​ Being on a Kalphite Slayer task for slayer helm and Genocidal is completely optional, but will result in slightly faster kills. ​ This guide assumes no green shields happen, but they are very rare and generally won't ruin kills. ​ Preset and Relics ⬥ Ranged ​ Notes ⬥ set the autofire rate to 1. ⬥ switch has to prevent stuns for almost the entire kill. ⬥ and increase damage to help ensure the rotation ends consistently at 13.2-14.4 seconds. ⬥ Toss the 1-2 ticks before clicking on Kalphite King, otherwise Melee phase might null your click. ​ Rotation Pre-build: → Enter portal Easier build: Enter instance + drop → → → → → → → → s (at 2 stacks) ​ Harder build (more consistent): → Enter instance + drop → → → → → → s → r + → s (at 2 stacks) In the fight: r + → ‎ ‎ → → ( 2t later) → → ​ If you don't kill after the last , finish with and improvise. ​ If you get Melee phase spawn, after and using over the first is an option to help ensure a 13.2 second kill, but not necessary. ​ Post-fight building: Target kalphite marauder + → → ​ These ensure you can both skip gaining adrenaline at crystal for and avoid the during the pre-build, saving both banking time and supplies. The harder build also makes it harder to gain adrenaline from if you get a slower kill if you time wrong. ​ Example Kills Example Kills ⬥ 90 kph",
